          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mub 4:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Saulo yaagira ekiniga kingi, ekyo kigambo kyamugwisa kubi; yaagira ati: Daudi baamubarira obukumi, nyowe bambarira enkumi zonka. Mbwenu shi ekindi atsigariire ki? T'okuza aha ngoma? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga obwo Saulo yaaguma naareeba Daudi eriisho ribi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.16.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 16:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku bwaseesire, omwoyo mubi ogwarugire ahari Ruhanga gwaza ahari Saulo n'amaani, yaasharira omu nju ye; obwo Daudi akaba naateera enanga nk'obutoosha; kandi Saulo akaba aine eicumu omu ngaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.19.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 19:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.20.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Saulo yaarirekyera; ahakuba akateekateeka ati: Niinyija kucumita Daudi, eicumu ryogyemu rikwate ekisiika. Daudi yaamweshumba kabiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
